{"id":"d4ac523055965e48","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-projective-hierarchy.md","title":"Projective Hierarchy","display":"df-projective-hierarchy — Projective Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projective-hierarchy","aliases":["58-df-projective-hierarchy"],"display":"df-projective-hierarchy — Projective Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-projection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projective-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projective-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective-hierarchy — Projective Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" href=\"?note=e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" title=\"58-df-projection\">58-df-projection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau_X)\">\\((X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> (Polish space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N=\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal N=\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> (Baire space with its standard topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_X\">\\(\\pi_X\\)</span> (first-coordinate projection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" href=\"?note=e8edb0ea1617bd4e\" title=\"58-df-projection\">58-df-projection</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\mathcal B(Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span> (Borel sigma-algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (positive projective level)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathcal N\\coloneqq\\omega^\\omega,\\qquad \\Sigma_1^1(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B(X\\times\\mathcal N,\\tau_X\\times\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\;(A=\\pi_X(B))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}hierarchy} \\vdash \\mathcal N\\coloneqq\\omega^\\omega,\\qquad \\Sigma_1^1(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B(X\\times\\mathcal N,\\tau_X\\times\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\;(A=\\pi_X(B))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}pointclass} \\vdash \\Pi_1^1(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:X\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_1^1(X)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coanalytic\\text{-}pointclass} \\vdash \\Pi_1^1(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:X\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_1^1(X)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\Sigma_{n+1}^1(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\Pi_n^1(X\\times\\mathcal N)\\;(A=\\pi_X(B))\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\Sigma_{n+1}^1(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\Pi_n^1(X\\times\\mathcal N)\\;(A=\\pi_X(B))\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}pi\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\Pi_{n+1}^1(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:X\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_{n+1}^1(X)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}pi\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\Pi_{n+1}^1(X)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq X:X\\setminus A\\in\\Sigma_{n+1}^1(X)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}delta\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\\Delta_n^1(X)\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^1(X)\\cap\\Pi_n^1(X)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}delta\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\\Delta_n^1(X)\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^1(X)\\cap\\Pi_n^1(X)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>射影层级从 Borel 集在 Baire-space 坐标上的投影，即解析集开始。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^1\">\\(\\Sigma_1^1\\)</span> = Analytic, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^1\">\\(\\Pi_1^1\\)</span> = Coanalytic</li>\n<li>补运算与投影运算交替生成有限射影层级；这里的点类显式记录环境空间。</li>\n<li>Projective Determinacy 不是 ZFC 的定理，其一致性强度与大基数理论密切相关。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","lev